<title>USA: Southeastern Michigan sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Southeastern Michigan sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>PORT HURON, Mich. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southeastern Michigan Gas Enterprises Inc said Tuesday it declared a five percent common stock dividend.</p>
<p>The firm said it will also pay a quarterly dividend of $0.578125 per share on the outstanding $2.3125 Series A Convertible Cumulative Preferred Stock.</p>
<p>The dividends are payable May 15 to shareholders of record May 5.</p>
